## Attempt-1 defect (ruling 2026-09-16e) re-verified fixed
Re-ran the RC3.1 reproduction on a57394c: a rollover-clamped, already-ended
expense (StartMonth 0 / EndMonth 0) now renders as a display-only card
("Ended before the plan start (<label>)") with no hx-put/inputs, and a
clamped-start row (StartMonth 0, EndMonth>0) reads "Since plan start
(<label>)" with its Starts input carrying the plan-start month. Confirmed via
the shipped `TestRC3OracleClampedRowsRoundTrip` (oracle.2.log ends "ORACLE
PASS") and my own re-derivation of the same fixture. The specific attempt-1
symptom (Through input below its own min, 400 on an untouched re-save) is
gone: `git diff 1f9a35a a57394c -- .../expense-sources-list.html` shows the
`{{if scheduleEnded .EndMonth}}` branch (`scheduleEnded` = `EndMonth != nil
&& *EndMonth <= 0`, added in internal/templates/render.go) producing the
display-only markup, byte-identical treatment mirrored in
income-sources-list.html.

